# Do not put real values in this template. Run python3 scripts/dev-env.py for local random credentials.
# Required: CHARGEHUB_DB_PASSWORD MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD CHARGEHUB_DEMO_PASSWORD
# Required: CHARGEHUB_PAYMENT_KEY CHARGEHUB_DEVICE_KEY CHARGEHUB_CONTROL_KEY
# Required by local Compose/monitoring: CHARGEHUB_MONITOR_PASSWORD (independent of demo password)
# Optional: CHARGEHUB_FIXED_TIME (dev/test business clock only)
# Optional: CHARGEHUB_AUTH_LOGIN_ACCOUNT_LIMIT=10 CHARGEHUB_AUTH_LOGIN_ADDRESS_LIMIT=60
# Login budgets are server settings, apply to all attempts per 60 seconds, and accept 1..100000.
# Current integration IDs default to payment/device/control. Rotated IDs and overlapping keys
# require explicit Spring configuration; see chargehub-identity/README.md.
